stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: Referral status
  accDescr: New referral becomes SENT. SENT goes to ACKNOWLEDGED or FLOATING when the hospital declines. ACKNOWLEDGED can also float. FLOATING goes back to SENT when the patient chooses a hospital. Arrival can be confirmed from SENT, ACKNOWLEDGED or FLOATING, by whichever hospital the patient reached. ARRIVAL_CONFIRMED goes to COMPLETED on recording the outcome.
  [*] --> SENT: New referral
  SENT --> ACKNOWLEDGED: Hospital accepts
  SENT --> FLOATING: Hospital declines
  ACKNOWLEDGED --> FLOATING: Hospital declines
  FLOATING --> SENT: Patient chooses a hospital
  SENT --> ARRIVAL_CONFIRMED: Patient walks in
  ACKNOWLEDGED --> ARRIVAL_CONFIRMED: Hospital confirms
  FLOATING --> ARRIVAL_CONFIRMED: Patient walks in
  ARRIVAL_CONFIRMED --> COMPLETED: Hospital records outcome
  COMPLETED --> [*]: 42-day plan continues
